@model PEMS.Application.DTOs.HelpStandardReferenceAdminEditDto
@using Microsoft.Extensions.Localization
@using PEMS.Web.Resources
@inject IStringLocalizer<SharedResource> Localizer
@{
    ViewData["HidePageTitle"] = true;
    var isEdit = Model.HelpStandardReferenceId > 0;
    var categories = (IEnumerable<dynamic>)ViewBag.Categories;
    var allArticles = (IEnumerable<dynamic>)ViewBag.AllArticlesForRelated;
    var applicabilityStatuses = new[] { "Applicable", "PotentiallyApplicable", "ContextDependent", "ReferenceOnly", "NotVerified", "NotApplicable" };
    var verificationStatuses = new[] { "OfficialSourceVerified", "PublisherMetadataVerified", "RepositoryMappingVerified", "ExpertReviewRequired", "NotVerified" };
    var implementationStatuses = new[] { "NotImplemented", "PartiallyRelated", "ConceptuallyMapped", "ImplementedButNotComplianceVerified", "ComplianceEvidenceAvailable", "NotApplicable", "NotVerified" };
}

<div class="content-card">
    <h5 class="mb-3"><i class="bi bi-journal-bookmark"></i> @(isEdit ? "Edit" : "New") Standard Reference</h5>

    @if (!ViewData.ModelState.IsValid)
    {
        <div class="alert alert-danger">
            @foreach (var err in ViewData.ModelState.Values.SelectMany(v => v.Errors))
            {
                <div>@err.ErrorMessage</div>
            }
        </div>
    }

    <form asp-action="@(isEdit ? "StandardEdit" : "StandardCreate")" asp-route-id="@(isEdit ? Model.HelpStandardReferenceId : (int?)null)" method="post">
        @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
        <input type="hidden" asp-for="HelpArticleId" />

        <div class="row g-3">
            <div class="col-md-3">
                <label class="form-label">Identifier <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                <input asp-for="Identifier" class="form-control" required placeholder="e.g. ISO 14224" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-5">
                <label class="form-label">Issuing Organization <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                <input asp-for="IssuingOrganization" class="form-control" required placeholder="e.g. International Organization for Standardization (ISO)" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <label class="form-label">Edition / Year</label>
                <input asp-for="EditionOrYear" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. 2016" />
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label">Official Reference URL</label>
                <input asp-for="OfficialReferenceUrl" class="form-control" type="url" placeholder="https://www.iso.org/standard/..." />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label">Related Module (free text)</label>
                <input asp-for="RelatedModule" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. CMMS / Reliability &amp; Maintenance" />
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <label class="form-label">Applicability Status</label>
                <select asp-for="ApplicabilityStatus" class="form-select">
                    @foreach (var s in applicabilityStatuses) { <option value="@s">@s</option> }
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <label class="form-label">Verification Status</label>
                <select asp-for="VerificationStatus" class="form-select">
                    @foreach (var s in verificationStatuses) { <option value="@s">@s</option> }
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <label class="form-label">PEMS Implementation Status</label>
                <select asp-for="PEMSImplementationStatus" class="form-select" id="implStatus">
                    @foreach (var s in implementationStatuses) { <option value="@s">@s</option> }
                </select>
                <div class="form-text text-danger" id="complianceWarning" style="display:none">
                    "ComplianceEvidenceAvailable" requires a real Evidence Path below - it must never be used without one.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label">Evidence Path (repo file/class this mapping is based on)</label>
                <input asp-for="EvidencePath" class="form-control" placeholder="e.g. PEMS.Domain/Entities/RcmFmea.cs (FMEAItem.RiskPriorityNumber)" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <label class="form-label">@Localizer["Notes"]</label>
                <input asp-for="Notes" class="form-control" />
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-4">
                <label class="form-label">Code <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                <input asp-for="Code" class="form-control" required placeholder="e.g. standard-iso-14224" />
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <label class="form-label">Category <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                <select asp-for="HelpCategoryId" class="form-select" required>
                    @foreach (var c in categories) { <option value="@c.HelpCategoryId">@c.NameEn</option> }
                </select>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <label class="form-label">@Localizer["Display Order"]</label>
                <input asp-for="DisplayOrder" type="number" class="form-control" />
            </div>

            <div class="col-12">
                <div class="form-check">
                    <input asp-for="IsPublished" type="checkbox" class="form-check-input" />
                    <label asp-for="IsPublished" class="form-check-label">@Localizer["Published (visible to all users)"]</label>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-12"><hr /></div>

            <div class="col-12">
                <ul class="nav nav-tabs" role="tablist">
                    <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link active" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-en" type="button">@Localizer["English"]</button></li>
                    <li class="nav-item"><button class="nav-link" data-bs-toggle="tab" data-bs-target="#tab-fa" type="button">@Localizer["فارسی"]</button></li>
                </ul>
                <div class="tab-content border border-top-0 p-3">
                    <div class="tab-pane fade show active" id="tab-en">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label">Title (EN) <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                            <input asp-for="TitleEn" class="form-control" required />
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label">Summary / Scope (EN) <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                            <textarea asp-for="SummaryEn" class="form-control" rows="2" required></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label">Content (EN, HTML) <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                            <textarea asp-for="ContentEn" class="form-control" rows="10" required></textarea>
                            <div class="form-text">Suggested sections: What it is / Why it matters / PEMS relevance / Current PEMS coverage / Outside current PEMS scope. Never copy official standard text.</div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label">@Localizer["Search Keywords (EN)"]</label>
                            <input asp-for="SearchKeywordsEn" class="form-control" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="tab-fa" dir="rtl">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label">عنوان (فارسی) <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                            <input asp-for="TitleFa" class="form-control" required />
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label">خلاصه / محدوده (فارسی) <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                            <textarea asp-for="SummaryFa" class="form-control" rows="2" required></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label">متن (فارسی، HTML) <span class="text-danger">*</span></label>
                            <textarea asp-for="ContentFa" class="form-control" rows="10" required></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label">@Localizer["کلیدواژه‌های جستجو (فارسی)"]</label>
                            <input asp-for="SearchKeywordsFa" class="form-control" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-12"><hr /></div>

            <div class="col-12">
                <label class="form-label">Related Articles (Concepts, Discipline Guides, Page Guides)</label>
                <select name="RelatedArticleIds" class="form-select" multiple size="6">
                    @foreach (var a in allArticles)
                    {
                        var selected = Model.RelatedArticleIds.Contains((int)a.HelpArticleId);
                        <option value="@a.HelpArticleId" selected="@selected">@a.Title (@a.Code)</option>
                    }
                </select>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-3 d-flex gap-2">
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-pems-solid">@Localizer["Save"]</button>
            <a asp-action="StandardMatrix" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Back to matrix</a>
        </div>
    </form>
</div>

<script>
    document.getElementById('implStatus').addEventListener('change', function () {
        document.getElementById('complianceWarning').style.display = this.value === 'ComplianceEvidenceAvailable' ? '' : 'none';
    });
</script>
